---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout>
	<div class="container page-content">
		<h1 class="page-title">About the Project</h1>
		<div class="content-wrapper">
			<p class="intro">
				The RdRp Summit is a collaborative initiative dedicated to the study of RNA-dependent RNA polymerase (RdRp).
				Our goal is to bring together researchers from around the world to share knowledge, data, and tools.
			</p>
			
			<hr class="divider" />
			
			<h2>Mission</h2>
			<p>
				We aim to provide a comprehensive resource for the classification, discovery, and analysis of RdRp sequences
				from diverse environments. By standardizing methods and data formats, we facilitate easier comparison
				and meta-analysis across different studies.
			</p>

			<h2>History</h2>
			<p>
				Started as a small workshop, the RdRp Summit has grown into a global community.
				We hold regular meetings and maintain this centralized repository of information.
			</p>

			<h2>Organizers</h2>
			<p>
				Meet the people who have contributed to organizing and supporting the RdRp Summit over time.
			</p>
			<p>
				<a href="/people" class="link-arrow">View organizers →</a>
			</p>

			<h2>Community</h2>
			<p>
				Ongoing discussions, method sharing, and follow-up conversations around RdRp research,
				the summit, and journal clubs take place in our community Slack workspace.
				Whether you have questions, want to share findings, or simply connect with others in the field,
				you are welcome to join.
			</p>
			<p>
				<a href="https://forms.gle/oPdeSmmLnQTi8UAB8" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link-arrow">Join Slack →</a>
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.page-content {
		max-width: 720px; /* Narrower for better reading experience */
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.page-title {
		margin-top: var(--space-page-title-top);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-page-title-bottom);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.content-wrapper {
		font-size: var(--fs-body);
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: #333;
	}

	.intro {
		font-size: var(--fs-intro);
		font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
		color: var(--c-text);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-section-tight);
	}

	.divider {
		border: 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--c-divider);
		margin: var(--space-section-tight) 0;
	}

	h2 {
		margin-top: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		font-size: 2rem;
		line-height: 1.3;
	}

	.link-arrow {
		color: var(--c-accent, #0066cc);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: var(--fw-semibold);
	}

	.link-arrow:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
</style>
